deshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le12ob11re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le12ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le12ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le12ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Kristi, will you be applying for this position?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I don't know yet. We will only have been working as editorial assistants for a month next week. Are we ready to take on all these new responsibilities?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I don't think I'm capable of keeping up with the position. Having been given all these tasks as an editorial assistant has kept me busy. You should definitely apply though. You'd be perfect. <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'll think about it. You saw the duties and responsibilities, didn't you? There'll be a lot to be taken on. I don't want to end up biting off more than I can chew \u2026  but I do love being given a challenge."}, {"time": "37000", "image": "engenn10le12ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I feel I've been drowning in work. I'm constantly trying to keep up with the demands.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You need to stay positive, Adam. You've been doing a great job. Boris wouldn't have told us about the position if he didn't think we could do well. Besides, I think being promoted to junior editor would be cool.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Sure, but being bossed around by us wouldn't be fun.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Just think of it like this Adam, in a few years we could be like Boris! We'll have been working in the industry for a while.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: And we'll have been writing copy for book jackets for ages.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hey! I didn't mind doing that assignment.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I only finished that assignment because I copied your notes which I still owe you for."}, {"time": "80000", "image": "engenn10le12ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: You can thank me by doing all the legwork for our next assignment.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Speaking of assignments, I've been trying to get a hold of this person I want to interview.  I will have been waiting to hear from them for a week.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What are you talking about? Have you been assigned something new by Boris?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: No, this is something I've taken on myself, more of a personal assignment ..."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}